    "result_text": "The change is complete and both tests pass with a clean build.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the invoice lifecycle **Draft \u2192 Sent \u2192 Paid** as a full-stack, additive change:\n\n**Database** (`V8__invoices_status_draft_default.sql`)\n- New Flyway migration switching the invoice `status` default from `UNPAID` to `DRAFT`, so new invoices start as drafts.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST)\n- New `POST /api/invoices/send` endpoint (`send.POST.yml` + `InvoicesSendPostLogic` + `SendInvoice` body): flips a `DRAFT` invoice to `SENT`, rejecting anything not in draft, and records the audit line `INVOICE_SENT id=<id> amount=<amount>` via the injected `Audit` service.\n- `InvoiceRepository`: added `markSent(id)` and changed `create(...)` to return `DRAFT`.\n- `InvoicesPayPostLogic`: now guards payment \u2014 an invoice can only be paid once it is `SENT` (returns 409 otherwise), matching \"only let me take payment once it has been sent.\"\n\n**Front-end** (`ProjectInvoices.tsx`)\n- Added a `sendInvoice` action calling the new endpoint.\n- Gated the row actions by status: a **Send** button (`invoice-send-<id>`) shows only for `DRAFT`, the **Mark paid** button (`invoice-pay-<id>`) shows only for `SENT`, and neither shows once `PAID`.\n\nThe existing seed support already accepted a `status` field, so no changes were needed there. `bin/e2e` reports **2 passed** with no build errors.",
